{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky mushrooms, greedy lumberjacks, endless battles. Grow and upgrade your defences to protect the forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/ba4f3112671d4e2df4479026cf6b8c62.poster.avif?t=1756820929\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/ba4f3112671d4e2df4479026cf6b8c62.webm?t=1756820929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/ba4f3112671d4e2df4479026cf6b8c62.mp4?t=1756820929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why it\u2019s spore-tacular:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 No cookie-cutter maps here! Every island is procedurally generated with rivers, forests, and choke points that force you to rethink your strategy every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 No lanes, no rails! Lumberjacks wander freely, hacking out roads and bridges as they go. You\u2019ll need to defend from every angle, not just a straight line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 Axe-wielding weirdos! From speedy sprinters to flamethrower fanatics \u2014 and massive boss jacks \u2014 every enemy type brings a new headache.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 Nature fights dirty! Poisonous Shrooms, exploding Shrooms, natural-disaster-summoning Shrooms \u2014 each species has unique powers, strengths, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf44 Super-size your Shrooms! Specialize your Shrooms into unstoppable fungi or spread your power across an army of squishy defenders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/39610c30659f9e7d003ce6ce152f2269.poster.avif?t=1756820929\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/39610c30659f9e7d003ce6ce152f2269.webm?t=1756820929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/39610c30659f9e7d003ce6ce152f2269.mp4?t=1756820929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf32 Jacks keep coming, you keep Shrooming \ud83c\udf32</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two invasions are the same. Each run gives you new islands, new enemy paths, and new choices: where to build, what to sacrifice, and how to make those lumberjacks regret picking up an axe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/c8648480dcc1a7d88d0d409df373a27a.poster.avif?t=1756820929\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/c8648480dcc1a7d88d0d409df373a27a.webm?t=1756820929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/c8648480dcc1a7d88d0d409df373a27a.mp4?t=1756820929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude93 Lumberjacks never learn \ud83e\ude93</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave after wave, they\u2019ll come. They\u2019ll burn, chop, and bulldoze everything in sight. You won\u2019t save every tree\u2026 but you can make sure the lumberjacks pay for every splinter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/4fda06192611ef8b3cbb4b4b06a01908.poster.avif?t=1756820929\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/4fda06192611ef8b3cbb4b4b06a01908.webm?t=1756820929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/4fda06192611ef8b3cbb4b4b06a01908.mp4?t=1756820929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3310170?t=1756820929","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/d6a57f8d0078bb9ca8c9afdd347ca7a643fc3513/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756820929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/320db05bc9871ef01068623e537780ce304b92a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756820929","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/320db05bc9871ef01068623e537780ce304b92a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756820929","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3517000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky mushrooms, greedy lumberjacks, endless battles. Grow and upgrade your defences to protect the forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/ba4f3112671d4e2df4479026cf6b8c62.poster.avif?t=1756820929\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310170/extras/ba4f3112671d4e2df4479026cf6b8c62.webm?t=1756820929\" type=\